WEBVTT

00:15:58.221 --> 00:16:01.439
it was created 
on very important principles

00:16:01.439 --> 00:16:04.400
that wanted to distinguish 
itself from the rest.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:08.139
One principle is related 
to the multidisciplinary approach

00:16:08.139 --> 00:16:12.079
and the providing programs 
and research aspects.

00:16:12.079 --> 00:16:15.258
As you know, a lot of the challenges, 
a lot of the problems

00:16:15.258 --> 00:16:17.681
that we are facing 
right now in the university

00:16:17.681 --> 00:16:21.823
are multidisciplinary 
or interdisciplinary types of problems.

00:16:21.823 --> 00:16:26.489
You need to have students 
while they are really heavily disciplined

00:16:26.489 --> 00:16:28.699
or very anchored in their disciplines.

00:16:28.699 --> 00:16:31.929
They need to understand 
the well-rounded information